{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106020","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410602001:0":{"text":"この者たちは、非難されて然るべき罪人です。","source_cn":"诸位，尽情用你们的目光谴责这些罪人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE6C207903678B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410602002:0":{"text":"彼らが恩恵を得られているのも、慈悲深い陛下のおかげだというのに……","source_cn":"若不是女王陛下垂怜，这些平民怎能蒙受至高的恩典？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BC392C30E83D29B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410602003:0":{"text":"些細なことで彼らは道を誤り、陛下の善意を裏切りました！","source_cn":"然而，面对稍许风雨扬起的尘沙时，他们竟在其中迷失方向，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B120C5E6836BC75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410602004:0":{"text":"これは許しがたい冒涜です！女王陛下の御名において、改悛の見込みなきすべての者に、死の裁きを！","source_cn":"这是何等的亵渎，何等的冒犯！在此，我将以女王之名，对所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ACFFFDA62ADB8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410602005:1":{"text":"すべて？まさか、ここにいる平民全員のことかい？","source_cn":"所有……？你该不会是指，在场的所有平民吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD68BE5D4B9C88D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410602006:0":{"text":"騒ぎに巻き込まれただけの者に罪はないだろう。そこは区別して――","source_cn":"有些人是被裹挟入此次骚乱的，这些人什么都没有做。若能详...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA9E931723F97D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410602007:1":{"text":"サリエ殿は陛下と同じく、お優しい心をお持ちですね……","source_cn":"沙利叶，我承认，你继承了女王那慈悲的心肠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F3F7994FA6263AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410602008:0":{"text":"ですが、今回の騒ぎで一人の上級司祭が行方不明になりました。おそらく、今頃はもう暴徒たちの手によって……","source_cn":"但是，一位高阶祭司在这场暴乱中消失了，他很可能已经被这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11022BBF9B9C994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410602009:0":{"text":"怖くなって隠れてるだけかもしれない。何でも悪い方向に考えるのはキミの悪い癖だ。","source_cn":"你总是把一切往坏处想，他也可能只是吓得躲起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C53BAA3D8CF6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410602010:0":{"text":"これ以上罪人の庇い立てはおやめください、サリエ殿！","source_cn":"不要再为这些罪人辩解了，沙利叶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5880991772158C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410602011:1":{"text":"エイン様！","source_cn":"冕下！奎茵冕下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC01E13997FC7D756","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410602012:0":{"text":"フェリル？","source_cn":"斐利尔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFE56CC27DB6604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410602013:0":{"text":"この子が行方不明の司祭？だから言ったじゃないか。","source_cn":"就是他？我说什么来着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE418114BD34219A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410602014:1":{"text":"……\n無事だったのですね、フェリル。陛下のご加護に感謝……","source_cn":"……\\n亲爱的斐利尔，太好了，女王保佑，你平安无事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD002E2871820A6FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410602015:0":{"text":"捜索に行かせた者たちから何も知らせがないので、てっきり何かあったのかと……","source_cn":"你在暴乱之中失去了踪迹，我派了许多人去找你，但一直毫无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAC36CCC3DA03EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410602016:0":{"text":"ご心配をかけて申し訳ありません。実は、道に迷ってしまって。","source_cn":"抱歉，我、我只是……一时迷了路，让您担心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5587AE06FBE0C490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410602017:0":{"text":"そうでしたか。誰しも道に迷うことはありますが、心に陛下の教えがある限り、必ず正しい道に戻れます。","source_cn":"迷路不可怕，只要牢记女王陛下赐予的恩典，我们终将会回到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BD923A6A794443D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410602018:0":{"text":"ありがとうございます、エイン様。こうして僕も無事に戻りましたし、無実の人たちを解放してもかまいませんよね？","source_cn":"谢谢您，冕下。但您能否饶过这些无辜的人？您看，我没事，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93F0E222E1245B34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410602019:0":{"text":"しー……あなたは優しい子ですね。ですが、彼らが何をしたのか知っていますか？","source_cn":"嘘……我知道你是个善良的孩子，你如此轻易地宽容了他们的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91450B0D808A6CEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410602020:0":{"text":"な、何をしたのですか？","source_cn":"做……做了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFBC452D42AB3F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410602021:0":{"text":"我々から恵の霊水を奪った暴徒は、それを欲深い平民たちに分け与えたのです。","source_cn":"那些恶徒从我们手中抢走了大量恩典灵露，分给贪婪索取的平民们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75125A637F9BA8D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410602022:1":{"text":"あなたの言う無実の人たちは、本来得るべきではない恩恵を平然と受け取ったのですよ。","source_cn":"你口中的无辜之人，心安理得地接受了这些不应属于他们的馈赠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x936770B24803E972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410602023:0":{"text":"霊水が数本盗まれるぐらい、大したことじゃないだろう。","source_cn":"当时局势混乱，抢走几瓶恩典灵露算不上什么大事吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE375AA8E029EFDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410602024:1":{"text":"いい加減にしてください、サリエ殿！たとえ一本でも陛下の貴重なお恵みです！","source_cn":"沙利叶！至高的恩典得来不易，你休得一再替暴徒狡辩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C114C63701C305D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410602025:0":{"text":"我々のために、陛下がどれほどお辛い思いをされているか……このまま見過ごしては、彼らをつけあがらせるだけです。","source_cn":"为了给予我们慈爱的恩典，女王独自承受了太多！宽容只会被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363BBE7AB3525884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410602026:1":{"text":"あの……陛下が辛い思いをしているのは……なぜですか？","source_cn":"可是……女王她，究竟承受了什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6038293369C52FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410602027:0":{"text":"え……？","source_cn":"嗯……？<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E912766F040572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410602028:0":{"text":"だって……恵の霊水は、本当は……陛下のお力ではないのでしょう……？","source_cn":"因为……恩典灵露，其实……并不是女王的力量……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AF5EBF0E6BB8BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410602029:0":{"text":"霊水は、オルムエッグから採れるものでは？","source_cn":"恩典灵露，不是源于龙蛋吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE262F860E38C3694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410602030:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410602031:0":{"text":"フェリル、何を言っているのです？","source_cn":"斐利尔，你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606F48982F861927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410602032:0":{"text":"だから、霊水はオルムエッグと呼ばれる竜の卵から――","source_cn":"龙蛋。恩典灵露其实是龙蛋的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1FC2AB05D5D7AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410602033:0":{"text":"黙りなさい！","source_cn":"住口！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B3B81C30A7C6DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1410602034:0":{"text":"でも、この目で見たんです！本当です！","source_cn":"可我看到了！是真的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49B42510FBBF75EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1410602035:0":{"text":"フェリル……嘘はおよしなさい！","source_cn":"斐利尔……你在撒谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x743B90CD456FDFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奎茵":{"text":"エイン","source":"奎茵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"サリエ","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斐利尔":{"text":"フェリル","source":"斐利尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":36,"localized_text_count":35,"speaker_count":3}}